Ozen bundles or downloads the following third-party material.

Speech recognition model
------------------------
itayinbar/Ozen-v1                               Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/itayinbar/Ozen-v1
  Hebrew speech recognition model distilled from ivrit-ai/whisper-large-v3-turbo,
  trained on that model's transcripts of ivrit.ai audio and ivrit.ai crowd
  transcriptions, used under the ivrit.ai licence
  (https://www.ivrit.ai/en/the-license/), which requires attribution.
  Thanks to ivrit.ai (https://www.ivrit.ai/).
  Base model: openai/whisper-base, MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI.
  The iPhone app bundles the ONNX files; the web app downloads them from the
  Hugging Face CDN at runtime.

