Optional runtime dependency (web)
---------------------------------
@ffmpeg/ffmpeg and @ffmpeg/core are fetched from a CDN only when a file is in a
container the browser cannot decode on its own. They are LGPL-licensed and are
never bundled into this application or linked into it at build time.

